# Base URL of the backend API.
#
# Leave it UNSET when the SPA and the API are served from the same origin
# (the production default). Set it only when they differ, e.g.:
#
#   VITE_API_BASE_URL=https://api.example.com
#
# In dev the app falls back to http://localhost:8000 automatically.
# A value containing "localhost" makes `npm run build` fail on purpose.
#VITE_API_BASE_URL=
